{"id":17385,"author":"dilpickel","body":"\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003eHello dilpickel here and I bring you my\u0026nbsp;twelfth\u0026nbsp;map! -wow!\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ch1 style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px; font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 48px; color: rgb(65, 65, 65); text-rendering: optimizeLegibility; font-size: 36px;\"\u003e\u003ci\u003eAiria Arena!\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/h1\u003e\u003ci\u003e1v1 and experimental gamemode!\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003ci style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eMap Name\u003c/b\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003e:\u0026nbsp;Airia arena.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eMap Gamemode\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e: Experimental and 1v1\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eMap Creator\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e: dilpickel.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e