:"In all honesty, for a 1v1, this map is atrocious for it.\u003cbr\u003eAll these structures, pits?, cactuses!?!, lol.\u003cbr\u003eWhats the enchantment table for?\u003cbr\u003eFix please, not suitable for what you want to test.","body_tagged":"In all honesty, for a 1v1, this map is atrocious for it.\u003cbr\u003eAll these structures, pits?, cactuses!?!, lol.\u003cbr\u003eWhats the enchantment table for?\u003cbr\u003eFix please, not suitable for what you want to test.","created_at":1445055888},{"id":240271,"author":"dilpickel","body":"The table and chests won't be in the 1v1 there for the other game. As for the structures and pits, why not. Now the cati could be removed idk yet. Thanks for the feedback :D.","body_tagged":"The table and chests won't be in the 1v1 there for the other game. As for the structures and pits, why not. Now the cati could be removed idk yet. Thanks for the feedback :D.","created_at":1445056281,"reply_to":240270}]}